ction starting at the point $I(10,0).$\n\n$x=$ \n{{field-1}}$,\\,y=$ \n{{field-2}}$,\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).$" :question/worked-solution "The parametric equations of an ellipse centered at the origin with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ are\n\n$$\nx=a\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,\\,y=b\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).\n$$\n\nUnder this parametrization, the ellipse is traversed once in the counterclockwise direction, starting from $(a,0).$\n\nIn our case, $a=10$ and $b=4.$ Therefore, the parametric equations of the ellipse are\n\n$$\nx=10\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,\\,y=4\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1f1988a8-3770-5656-84e1-09ce21c8ebb9" "answer-field-da64f4a6-5c11-512f-aa4b-74545a4bd468"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1f1988a8-3770-5656-84e1-09ce21c8ebb9" :answer-field/id #uuid "1f1988a8-3770-5656-84e1-09ce21c8ebb9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-69716a57-1ad8-5016-aba3-02a3013b5d00" :answer-field/choices ["answer-69716a57-1ad8-5016-aba3-02a3013b5d00"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-69716a57-1ad8-5016-aba3-02a3013b5d00" :answer/id #uuid "69716a57-1ad8-5016-aba3-02a3013b5d00" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10\\cos\\theta" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-da64f4a6-5c11-512f-aa4b-74545a4bd468" :answer-field/id #uuid "da64f4a6-5c11-512f-aa4b-74545a4bd468" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-9c96a497-2573-5cae-bc10-aef22b9df685" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9c96a497-2573-5cae-bc10-aef22b9df685"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9c96a497-2573-5cae-bc10-aef22b9df685" :answer/id #uuid "9c96a497-2573-5cae-bc10-aef22b9df685" :answer/type :answer.type/math 