c17cd5de1.png)\n\nWhich of the following sets of parametric equations, defined for $\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ),$ generate the ellipse shown above?" :question/worked-solution "The parametric equations of an ellipse centered at the point $(h,k)$ with a horizontal radius of length $a$ and a vertical radius of length $b$ are\n\n$$\nx=a\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +h,\\,y=b\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +k,\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).\n$$\n\nIn our case, the ellipse is centered at the point $(-2,3),$ $a=3$ and $b=6.$ Therefore, the parametric equations of the ellipse are\n\n$$\nx=3\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -2,\\,y=6\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +3,\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3f70034b-fd36-5c12-9141-c32f3cf668a6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3f70034b-fd36-5c12-9141-c32f3cf668a6" :answer-field/id #uuid "3f70034b-fd36-5c12-9141-c32f3cf668a6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c222c4b4-2ea3-582b-a422-05b9d5f10949" :answer-field/choices ["answer-23009b11-9874-5e52-a6ca-94d3d3dae7f4" "answer-23f67f20-4371-571f-9fd6-447dacee9a62" "answer-c222c4b4-2ea3-582b-a422-05b9d5f10949" "answer-5e84fb78-cea0-5a36-8408-61ccd964b66b" "answer-890c4312-8661-5c0b-8c41-8603b03d5f80"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-23009b11-9874-5e52-a6ca-94d3d3dae7f4" :answer/id #uuid "23009b11-9874-5e52-a6ca-94d3d3dae7f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=36\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -2,\\,y=9\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-23f67f20-4371-571f-9fd6-447dacee9a62" :answer/id #uuid "23f67f20-4371-571f-9fd6-447dacee9a62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x=3\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +2,\\,y=6\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c222c4b4-2ea3-582b-a422-05b9d5f10949" :answer/id #uuid "c222c4b4-2ea3-58